  "label": "User projected onto the chaotic riot scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the chaotic riot scene (chaotic_riot_scene) as the target of the meme's hateful message. The meme visually depicts the riots and overlays text falsely attributing organization to African American leaders, thereby projecting the user's perception onto the scene as a site of racialized blame and violence. The user is implicitly positioned as someone who might accept or be influenced by the false narrative, making the scene the focal point of the projection.",
